  "description": "FRAMESET\n\nFrame 6061 Alloy MTB hardtail frame, Step-Thru for 26” wheels, 2 sets water bottle braze-ons (1x for 14\", 16\"), Rear rack braze-ons, Decals protected by clear-coat\nFork Front suspension fork 100mm travel, w/lock-out, alloy crown + steel stanchions, 1 1/8/28.6 threadless\n\nWHEELSET\n\nRims Retrospec aluminum double-wall 32H, 20mm apex section, precision machined brake tracks with wear indicator\nHubs Aluminum, ball-bearing, 32H, QR Front/100mm & Rear/135mm\nSpokes 14G stainless steel\nTires Kenda K1153 27.5/26 x 2.10 (or Wanda 27.5/26 x 2.125 P1197A), S/V\n\nCOMPONENTS\n\nHeadset 1 1/8\" (28.6mm) steel, Threadless\nBrakes Tektro mechanical discs 160mm, w/aluminum brake levers\nHandlebars Alloy riser 720mm x 30mm rise, 31.8 clamp OD\nGrips Retrospec MTB\nStem Aluminum alloy Threadless,\nSaddle Retrospec MTB\nSeatpost Alloy 27.2mm x 350mm w/integrated seat clamp\nSeatpost Clamp Aluminum alloy\nPedals Alloy Platform, 9/16\"\n\nEXTRAS\n\nKickstand Alloy chainstay mount\n\nRecommended Weight Limit 250 LBS\n\n*Due to differences in screen resolutions, please note that colors may differ slightly.",
